<Base title="About" description="BORGAS is a founder-led electronics brand building racing systems and diagnostic tools through hands-on engineering."><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Behind BORGAS</p><h1>Practical problems.<br/>Purposeful electronics.</h1><p class="lede">BORGAS brings hands-on engineering to racing systems and diagnostic tools.</p></div><div class="brand-stage"><img src="/mark.png" alt="BORGAS raven and wordmark" width="511" height="437"/></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap reading"><h2>Built by doing.</h2><p>Founded by Devin, BORGAS develops hardware through building, testing and refinement. The work starts with a specific need: telemetry you can see at the wheel, or external measurements that help explain a machine fault.</p><p>Racing Systems and Diagnostic Systems share that approach while serving different users. The website keeps each product's role and development status visible, so you can distinguish a completed build from a prototype.</p><h2>Refinement is part of the work.</h2><p>Dashboard layouts are rendered from firmware before display changes reach the hardware. Diagnostic builds are checked against bench measurements. What testing reveals feeds back into the design and its documentation.</p><div class="actions"><Button href="/products/">Explore the products</Button><Button href="/contact/" variant="secondary">Contact BORGAS</Button></div></div></section></Base>
